        "baseErrorDetails": null,
        "bindings": {},
        "collapsed": false,
        "command": "%md\n## Create Customer Order Summary\n1. Join the tables Silver_Customers, Silver_addresses and Silver_Orders\n1. Retrieve the latest Address of the Customer \n1. Calculate the following values\n    - total_orders\n    - total_items_ordered\n    - total_order_amount",
